{
  "summary": "This experiment tested combining multiprofile RNA data (pca_n2000) with multimodal image data (resnet50) using avgpool aggregation and concat fusion, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6186 and F1 of 0.6103, higher than the multiprofile RNA-only baseline (0.5907). The results suggest adding image modality may improve performance, though the specific contribution of the fusion method or aggregation strategy remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative configurations."
}

